Z||000000||merlinwarlock||03-06-2001||11:04 PM||||Sure Will. I lost first and second gear gradually, It became harder and harder to get it into first gear then it wouldn't go in gear at all then it started on second gear them same way. I took it to the guy that does all the services for my companies fleet vehicles,and he told me that the transmission was bad needed to be replaced. <p>[This message has been edited by merlinwarlock (edited 03-08-2001).]||||reg||5
Z||000001||Will||03-06-2001||11:46 PM||||What's wrong with your old trans? Paying a shop to fix one from the other will probably be more expensive than buying the FWD conversion linkages from <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com" TARGET=_blank>www.rodneydickman.com</A> <BR>That's moot, obviously if you're doing it yourself.<P>Since you're using a Beretta transmission, DEFINITELY get the extension housing and right axle from the Beretta and use them in your Fiero.<P>Another thing you might consider is buying the combination axle seal/extra bearing that both the fiero store and Rodney Dickman sell.<p>[This message has been edited by Will (edited 03-06-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||merlinwarlock||03-07-2001||01:29 AM||||QUOTE]Thanks Will, the old transmission broke I can't get first or second gear. I thought that since I have to crack open the cases of both trannsmissions to swap out the speedometer cog, that it might be easier to just replace what is broken in the first one. Just tring to find out if this is     do-able or not??   <P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Will||03-07-2001||10:05 AM||||Does your Beretta use the later type VSS? I just picked up a Beretta trans that uses the same VSS style as the Fiero.<P>Whether or not you can replace what's broken in the first one depends on what's broken in the first one.<BR>Can you give me a detailed description of what the trans does, and what your were doing when it broke?<P>Taking the gears and most of the rest of the mechanisms out of a Getrag requires a pretty specialized (read: expen$ive) assembly pallet and a large press.<BR>||||reg||1
